<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-vincy" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-vincy.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/march-21">21 March</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Charles Martel defeats Chilperic II and Ragenfrid at Vincy</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Near Cambrai, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/charles-martel">Charles Martel</a> and the Austrasians defeated the Neustrian king Chilperic II and his mayor of the palace, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ragenfrid">Ragenfrid</a>, in the civil war after <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pepin-of-herstal">Pepin of Herstal</a>'s death. The victory was a decisive step in Charles's rise to power.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-vincy">Battle of Vincy</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/frankish-civil-war-715-718">Frankish Civil War (715–718)</a></div></div></li><li class="tih-event-card"><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/march-25">25 March</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Theodosius III abdicates in favour of Leo III the Isaurian</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">The Byzantine emperor Theodosius III abdicated in favour of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/leo-iii-the-isaurian">Leo III the Isaurian</a>, the general who had captured his son. Leo founded the Isaurian dynasty and ended the Twenty Years' Anarchy, a period of rapidly changing emperors.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/leo-iii-the-isaurian">Leo III the Isaurian</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/byzantine-empire">Byzantine Empire</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
